<h2>AI Usage</h2>
<p>
  We use AI tools to help make this site, and we want to be upfront about where. A person directs,
  reviews, and approves everything published here.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Rules and writing.</strong> AI helps with drafting and editing text, clarifying rules,
    checking balance, and comparing options. A person decides what is published.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Artwork.</strong> The images on this site are AI-generated. A person chooses what is made,
    selects the result, and approves each image.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>The site itself.</strong> AI helps build and maintain the site's code and features, under
    human direction and review.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  AI can make mistakes. If something reads wrong, check it against the official Pathfinder rules and
  let us know.
</p>
<p>
  This site, its rules, and its artwork are free to use under the ORC license, and AI helps keep a
  free project going. We also strongly believe that where revenue is being generated, AI use should
  be limited, and humans should be paid for the unique insights, artistry, and skills they bring.
</p>
